{
  "version": 6,
  "_generated": "GENERATED by tools/fumbles-to-tables.mjs from data/fumble-pool.json — do not hand-edit.",
  "_shape": "One d20 table per attack type. Rows are UNORDERED PEERS — the die picks which fumble, not how bad it is. A row covers one face unless its entry is weighted with `faces`. Entries are shared: one id can appear in several tables.",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "<p>The attack carries on into a friend. Make a fresh attack against a random ally within reach, or in the line of fire. If there is none, nothing comes of it.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "ally-struck",
      "name": "Ally Struck",
      "special": {
        "kind": "reattack",
        "targets": "ally"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The blow lands on you harder than on anything else. That natural attack is bruised and weaker for a while.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "bruising-attack",
      "name": "Bruising Attack",
      "buffs": [
        "Bruising Attack"
      ],
      "buffTarget": "fumblingItem"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your opponent catches the limb as it comes in. They may make a free grapple attempt against you.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "caught-attack",
      "name": "Caught Attack"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The attack comes back on you. You take its damage as nonlethal damage.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "damage-self",
      "name": "Damage Self",
      "special": {
        "kind": "selfDamage"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>That went badly enough to shake your confidence.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "demoralizing-attack",
      "name": "Demoralizing Attack",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "shaken",
          "duration": {
            "value": "1d4",
            "units": "round"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your guard drops completely. Every enemy threatening you may make an attack of opportunity against you.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "dropped-defenses",
      "name": "Dropped Defenses"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The weapon flies out of your hand and lands 1d4 squares away in a random direction.</p>",
      "note": "Weak on the thrown table: the weapon was leaving the hand anyway. To be replaced there.",
      "id": "flung-weapon",
      "name": "Flung Weapon"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Dust, sweat or grit gets into your eyes. A move action clears them early.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "grit-in-the-eyes",
      "name": "Grit in the Eyes",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "blind",
          "duration": {
            "value": 1,
            "units": "round"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The weapon comes back and opens your face. It will heal into something memorable.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "horrific-facial-scar",
      "name": "Horrific Facial Scar",
      "buffs": [
        "Horrific Facial Scar"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "bleed",
          "bleed": {
            "formula": "1d4"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The mechanism catches. Your next reload takes an extra move action.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "jammed-mechanism",
      "name": "Jammed Mechanism"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>You hit something much harder than you meant to. You take the attack's minimum damage as nonlethal damage.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "like-hitting-a-wall",
      "name": "Like Hitting a Wall",
      "special": {
        "kind": "selfDamage",
        "minimize": true
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>It goes badly wrong, and somehow nothing comes of it.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "lucky-miss",
      "name": "Lucky Miss"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The miss pulls you off your stance, and you are slow to recover it.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "off-balance",
      "name": "Off Balance",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "flatFooted",
          "duration": {
            "value": 1,
            "units": "round"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The miss leaves you wide open. The creature you attacked may make an attack of opportunity against you.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "opened-defenses",
      "name": "Opened Defenses"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>You put your whole body into the throw and keep going.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "overcommitted-throw",
      "name": "Overcommitted Throw",
      "save": {
        "type": "ref",
        "dc": 10
      },
      "onFail": {
        "conditions": [
          {
            "id": "prone"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>You commit everything to the attack and have nothing left. You lose the rest of this turn's attacks, and cannot make attacks of opportunity until your next turn.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "overextended",
      "name": "Overextended"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your footing goes out from under you and you hit the ground.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "prone",
      "name": "Prone",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "prone"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The attack leaves you reeling.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "reeling-attack",
      "name": "Reeling Attack",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "staggered",
          "duration": {
            "value": 1,
            "units": "round"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your opponent sees the opening. They may make a free disarm attempt against you, with no penalty if it fails. On a success, they may take the weapon if they have a hand free.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "riposte",
      "name": "Riposte"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The string slips its notch. Restringing the weapon takes a full-round action.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "slipped-string",
      "name": "Slipped String"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The string snaps. The weapon is useless until the string is replaced.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "snapped-string",
      "name": "Snapped String"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your ammunition spills across the ground. Gathering it back up takes a move action.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "spilled-quiver",
      "name": "Spilled Quiver"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Something in your shoulder tears. It lasts until it is healed, or until a successful DC 15 Heal check treats it.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "strained-shoulder",
      "name": "Strained Shoulder",
      "buffs": [
        "Strained Shoulder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The string whips across your forearm and face.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "string-slap",
      "name": "String Slap",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "dazzled",
          "duration": {
            "value": 1,
            "units": "round"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>You stumble into a random open adjacent square. The movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "stumble",
      "name": "Stumble"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your own limbs get in each other's way.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "tangled-up",
      "name": "Tangled Up",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "entangled",
          "duration": {
            "value": 1,
            "units": "round"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your opponent has read your style. They gain a bonus on attacks against you for the rest of the fight.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "telegraphed-moves",
      "name": "Telegraphed Moves",
      "buffs": [
        "Telegraphed Moves"
      ],
      "recipient": "defender",
      "buffTarget": "fumbler"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Something gives with a crack. The weapon is broken.</p>",
      "note": "Weak on the thrown table unless the weapon is magic or returning. To be replaced there.",
      "id": "weapon-broken",
      "name": "Weapon Broken",
      "special": {
        "kind": "weaponBroken"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>Your grip fails and the weapon falls at your feet.</p>",
      "note": "Weak on the thrown table: the weapon was leaving the hand anyway. To be replaced there.",
      "id": "weapon-dropped",
      "name": "Weapon Dropped"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The next weapon catches as you reach for it. You lose the rest of this turn's attacks.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "weapon-snag",
      "name": "Weapon Snag"
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The weapon bites into something nearby and sticks there: the floor, a wall, a beam, the target's armor or shield.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "weapon-stuck",
      "name": "Weapon Stuck",
      "special": {
        "kind": "weaponStuck"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The full force of the attack goes into your own weapon. It takes the attack's damage, less its hardness.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "weapon-takes-damage",
      "name": "Weapon Takes Damage",
      "special": {
        "kind": "weaponDamage"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The effort takes the wind out of you. A short rest clears it.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "winded",
      "name": "Winded",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "id": "fatigued"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "<p>The attack finds someone else entirely. Make a fresh attack against a random different creature within reach, or in the line of fire, friend or foe.</p>",
      "note": null,
      "id": "wrong-target",
      "name": "Wrong Target",
      "special": {
        "kind": "reattack",
        "targets": "any"
      }
    }
  ],
